WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:11.054
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hey, Mr Fischer.

2
00:00:12.487 --> 00:00:13.357
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi.

3
00:00:13.997 --> 00:00:15.660
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Is that the new Sony?

4
00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:16.377
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What?

5
00:00:17.963 --> 00:00:20.471
Oh…yeah, it is.

6
00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:21.597
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Cool.

7
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:24.860
This is a great camera!

8
00:00:25.435 --> 00:00:26.331
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Um…

9
00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:29.555
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Can I take a photo?

10
00:00:31.103 --> 00:00:32.920
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Uh…Sure…

11
00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:35.249
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Not here.

12
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:36.400
Outside.

13
00:00:42.823 --> 00:00:43.680
Come on!

14
00:00:44.691 --> 00:00:46.559
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Is my bag OK here?

15
00:00:48.159 --> 00:00:48.939
Thank you.

16
00:00:49.144 --> 00:00:50.884
Wait…wait!

17
00:01:11.995 --> 00:01:13.837
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I love this camera.

18
00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.176
You’re American, right?

19
00:01:19.262 --> 00:01:21.680
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, I am.

20
00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.007
But my dad’s from Mexico.

21
00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:28.384
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Where are you from in the US?

22
00:01:30.035 --> 00:01:31.801
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m from California.

23
00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:34.922
From a very small town.

24
00:01:36.535 --> 00:01:38.159
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What do you think of London?

25
00:01:40.603 --> 00:01:41.665
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s nice.

26
00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:43.763
I like it.

27
00:01:45.248 --> 00:01:46.335
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Are you on holiday?

28
00:01:47.218 --> 00:01:49.726
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No. I’m a student.

29
00:01:50.621 --> 00:01:51.159
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Where?

30
00:01:51.926 --> 00:01:54.357
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> At the Tensquare School of Photography.

31
00:01:57.172 --> 00:01:58.631
I start on Thursday.

32
00:02:09.557 --> 00:02:10.299
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Tired?

33
00:02:13.357 --> 00:02:15.622
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m very tired.

34
00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:19.115
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Come with me.

35
00:02:22.441 --> 00:02:23.145
Come on.

36
00:02:23.618 --> 00:02:24.335
Let’s go.

37
00:02:52.163 --> 00:02:53.941
This is my favourite park.

38
00:02:55.016 --> 00:02:57.869
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s…perfect!

39
00:03:02.808 --> 00:03:04.164
Thank you.

40
00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.951
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> You’re welcome.

41
00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:11.585
Sorry.

42
00:03:13.351 --> 00:03:14.451
Work.

43
00:03:16.831 --> 00:03:18.520
Time to go.

44
00:03:26.657 --> 00:03:28.269
Bye, Mr Fischer.

45
00:03:32.082 --> 00:03:39.144
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Ben…My name’s Ben…Wait, what’s your name?